  "id": "the-override-protocol",
  "title": "The Override Protocol",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "A woman is brought to the hospital on the verge of death, with no name, no identity, just the label \"Jane Doe.\" But as she miraculously recovers, she soon discovers that something sinister has taken root inside her mind. An eerie, disembodied voice whispers commands that only she can hear. At first, she resists, but the voice wields a terrifying power: the ability to cause unbearable pain, even triggering a heart attack if she disobeys. Forced into compliance, Jane unknowingly becomes a pawn in the secretive organization known as OPD, an entity operating in the shadows with a chilling agenda. As she carries out the voice’s sinister orders, she begins piecing together the truth behind the ultimate mission: the \"Override Protocol,\" a mysterious operation with the potential to alter the course of the world. With time running out, Jane must find a way to break free from the voice’s control, unravel OPD’s intentions, and fight back before humanity is irreversibly changed. But will she succeed or has she already become the very thing she fears? Written, produced and directed by: 2e Production https://2eproduction.com/ AI Voices by: Eleven Labs https://elevenlabs.io/ Music and sound effects by Eleven Labs and Pixabay https://elevenlabs.io/ https://pixabay.com/",
